# The approved asset pack (SPECS §13): the art is committed, the rest is not.
#
# The PNGs are only 4 MB and they *define* the locked palette in
# content/palette.txt, so the repo has to carry them — a clone without them
# cannot run the asset tests. What is excluded:
#   - 97 MB of music and sound effects that nothing references, while §14 Audio
#     is still TBD. Nothing is decided, so nothing is vendored.
#   - 5 MB of animated GIF previews, which Godot does not import at all (no
#     .import file is generated for a single one of them).
# Both are re-downloadable from the itch.io URL recorded in
# assets/NinjaAdventure/LICENCE-as-downloaded.md.
assets/**/Audio/
assets/**/*.gif
